@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
title UC15: Voucher Campaign State Machine Diagram
[*] --> Draft : adminInitiatesCampaign
Draft --> Active : publishCampaign [currentDate >= startDate]
Active --> Depleted : quotaReached [redemptionCount >= usageQuota]
Active --> Expired : endDatePassed [currentDate > endDate]
Active --> Suspended : adminPausesCampaign
Suspended --> Active : adminResumesCampaign
Depleted --> Archived : archiveCampaign
Expired --> Archived : archiveCampaign
Archived --> [*]
@enduml
